<title>UK: RESEARCH ALERT-Lasmo cut at Kleinwort.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT-Lasmo cut at Kleinwort.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Oil exploration group Lasmo Plc was cut to &quot;hold&quot; from &quot;buy&quot; at Dresdner Kleinwort Benson, dealers said on Thursday.</p>
<p>Further detail was not immediately available.</p>
<p>The stock was down 6p at 268 by 0755 GMT in volume of 479,780 shares.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
